# nemeth.ctb -- Nemeth Code for Mathematics and Science Notation
#
# nemeth.ctb was removed from the liblouis 3.x table set.
# This wrapper delegates to en-us-mathtext.ctb which provides
# equivalent coverage for math notation in US Braille/Nemeth.
# Created for the Braillix project for liblouis >= 3.28 compatibility.

include en-us-mathtext.ctb
